{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46846","headline":"秋夕书怀 · 齐己","name":"秋夕书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉多夜永拥山袍，片石闲欹不觉劳。\n蟋蟀遶牀无梦寐，梧桐满地有萧骚。\n平生乐道心常切，五字逢人价合高。\n破落西窗向残月，露声如雨滴蓬蒿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}